  "prompts": {
    "image": "Create a photorealistic vertical 9:16 film start frame, close oblique overhead view from the visitor side. On the black KKN table lies one open black leather portfolio. The left cream page contains exactly four clean musical waveform rows with small play triangles; the right cream page is completely blank. Both pages are full rectangular sheets, lying completely flat, continuously and visibly attached to the central binding from top to bottom. The chairwoman's single left hand enters from above with a black patterned sleeve and purple cuff, pointing at a waveform on the left page. A cropped gold architectural star remains at viewer left and a small round gold emoji medal remains on the table at upper right. Preserve warm black-and-gold hall lighting. No loose sheet, lifted corner, triangular page, page turn, writing, extra hands, creator hands, captions or watermark.",
    "endFrameDescription": "",
    "animation": "0.0–1.4s: the chairwoman's left index finger moves slowly about 3 cm along the fourth waveform row, then stops above its end. 1.4–3.0s: she holds the pointing pose naturally. Camera: locked close insert. Secondary motion: only subtle finger tension and a small sleeve crease. Continuity: both full rectangular pages remain completely flat and visibly attached along the entire central binding; four waveforms stay on the left page, the right page stays blank, and the star and emoji medal remain stationary. Avoid any page lifting, turning, bending or detaching, loose sheets, writing, extra hands or fingers, changing graphics, camera motion, cuts, morphs, captions or watermarks."
